<title>USA: TRM Copy CFO Bruce to resign.</title>
<headline>TRM Copy CFO Bruce to resign.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>TRM Copy Centers Corp said Chief Financial Officer Robert Bruce will resign after year-end financial closings to join a privately held company.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to announce a replacement for Mr. Bruce prior to his departure in late August.</p>
</text>
